{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Shade:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A first-person psychological horror set in rural Finland, where isolation and unsettling encounters slowly turn your housekeeping job into something far more disturbing.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Arthur Bell, a young man who takes a job opportunity in the Finnish countryside. Travel deeper into the countryside, find the employer and get further information about the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/extras/08363fe57ecc0bafa03878ae2bdb4621.poster.avif?t=1764119320\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/extras/08363fe57ecc0bafa03878ae2bdb4621.webm?t=1764119320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/extras/08363fe57ecc0bafa03878ae2bdb4621.mp4?t=1764119320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Manor:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job as a housekeeper is divided into days, each offering new tasks, new places to investigate, and encounters that grow increasingly disturbing. Explore the manor, keep it in order, and collect items as the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/extras/c5c216774439ac662beddad4cba04c0f.poster.avif?t=1764119320\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/extras/c5c216774439ac662beddad4cba04c0f.webm?t=1764119320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/extras/c5c216774439ac662beddad4cba04c0f.mp4?t=1764119320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue choices</strong> that let you respond in different ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Driving</strong> between locations as you explore the countryside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric interiors and forests</strong> to investigate at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2-4 hours</strong> of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS tapes and cassettes</strong> you can find and play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense, scenarios</strong> focused on psychological fear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item use and tasks</strong> that lead to new story moments</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712390?t=1764119320","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/b5a0517b4f528b6b5f8bc53d8496c09fea4bd0ac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764119320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/6d44a51e719e3c4fdb21d695f52c356240eea02b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764119320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/6d44a51e719e3c4fdb21d695f52c356240eea02b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764119320","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_d